{
  "brief": {
    "idea": "Arc Science is a computational platform for designing biomolecules. One shared base serves four projects. Omniverso is the first.",
    "details": "A 12-slide pitch deck. Lenses: journal and cinematic. Check-ins: one storyboard stop. Outputs: live deck, MP4, PDF, web link.",
    "concepts": [
      "four projects on one shared base",
      "Omniverso and its nanobody target",
      "the model in brief",
      "how research is checked",
      "the request to Yandex Cloud"
    ],
    "audience": "a senior manager of Yandex Cloud and the Yandex Cloud science programme lead",
    "product": "arc-science",
    "langs": [
      "en",
      "ru"
    ],
    "timeBudget": {
      "hours": 8
    },
    "files": []
  },
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "f-platform",
      "text": {
        "en": "Arc Science (Arc Harness) is a scientific harness and computational platform for designing biomolecules.",
        "ru": "Arc Science (Arc Harness) — научная среда и вычислительная платформа для конструирования биомолекул."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-01-title"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s00-title",
        "s00-label-1",
        "mel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-four",
      "text": {
        "en": "Four projects stand on one shared base: Omniverso, Snoggo, RNAv-G, Arc Chemistry.",
        "ru": "Четыре проекта стоят на одной общей основе: Omniverso, Snoggo, RNAv-G, Arc Chemistry."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-02-platform"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s01-title",
        "s01-label-1",
        "v-tiles"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-proj-omniverso",
      "text": {
        "en": "Omniverso designs VHH nanobodies and antibodies for a chosen antigen.",
        "ru": "Omniverso конструирует нанотела VHH и антитела к выбранному антигену."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-02-platform"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s01-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-proj-snoggo",
      "text": {
        "en": "Snoggo estimates binding free energy changes for beta-tubulin mutations.",
        "ru": "Snoggo оценивает изменение свободной энергии связывания при мутациях бета-тубулина."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-02-platform"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s07-title",
        "s07-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-proj-rnavg",
      "text": {
        "en": "RNAv-G describes viral capsid assembly and genome placement.",
        "ru": "RNAv-G описывает сборку вирусного капсида и укладку генома."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-02-platform"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s08-title",
        "s08-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-proj-chem",
      "text": {
        "en": "Arc Chemistry selects extractants to separate neodymium and praseodymium.",
        "ru": "Arc Chemistry подбирает экстрагенты для разделения неодима и празеодима."
      },
      "level": "target",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-02-platform"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s09-title",
        "s09-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-workspaces",
      "text": {
        "en": "Unified C2 console with four workspaces (Research, Memory, Molecullage, Prose) and four connectors (Servers, Keys, Apps, Audit).",
        "ru": "Единая консоль C2 с четырьмя рабочими областями (Research, Memory, Molecullage, Prose) и четырьмя соединителями (Servers, Keys, Apps, Audit)."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-02-platform"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s02-title",
        "s02-label-1",
        "v-workspaces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-cammut",
      "text": {
        "en": "Cammut keeps memory and connectors; Arc Kit shares arc-core MCP, the 231-source Shelf and Workshop toolpacks; Molecullage is the film and figure engine.",
        "ru": "Cammut хранит память и соединители; Arc Kit объединяет сервер arc-core, полку из 231 источника и наборы инструментов; Molecullage строит фильмы и рисунки."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "studio/library/sources.json#summary"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s02-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-1mel",
      "text": {
        "en": "PDB 1MEL: camel VH in complex with lysozyme, 2.5 A.",
        "ru": "PDB 1MEL: домен VH верблюда в комплексе с лизоцимом, 2.5 А."
      },
      "level": "published",
      "source": {
        "kind": "doi",
        "ref": "10.1038/nsb0996-803"
      },
      "checked": "2026-11-09",
      "usedBy": [
        "s03-title",
        "s03-label-1",
        "mel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-contacts",
      "text": {
        "en": "In PDB 1MEL, 24 lysozyme residues and 18 nanobody residues form 55 residue pairs within 4.5 A (heavy atoms).",
        "ru": "В структуре PDB 1MEL 24 остатка лизоцима и 18 остатков нанотела образуют 55 пар остатков ближе 4.5 А по тяжелым атомам."
      },
      "level": "published",
      "source": {
        "kind": "doi",
        "ref": "10.1038/nsb0996-803"
      },
      "checked": "2026-11-09",
      "usedBy": [
        "s03-label-1",
        "s04-title",
        "s04-label-1",
        "contacts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-cdr3",
      "text": {
        "en": "One half of CDR3 contacts the VH region; the other half protrudes and penetrates deeply into the active site of lysozyme.",
        "ru": "Одна половина петли CDR3 касается домена VH, а вторая половина глубоко входит в активный центр лизоцима."
      },
      "level": "published",
      "source": {
        "kind": "doi",
        "ref": "10.1038/nsb0996-803"
      },
      "checked": "2026-11-09",
      "usedBy": [
        "s05-title",
        "s05-label-1",
        "mel-site"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-ae",
      "text": {
        "en": "The autoencoder has 255,873,676 parameters, calculated from module shapes (no weights).",
        "ru": "Автокодировщик содержит 255,873,676 параметров по размерам слоев без обученных весов."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#om-02-autoencoder"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s06-title",
        "s06-label-1",
        "v-model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-dn",
      "text": {
        "en": "The denoiser has 153,102,091 parameters, calculated from module shapes (no weights).",
        "ru": "Модуль снятия шума содержит 153,102,091 параметров по размерам слоев без обученных весов."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#om-03-denoiser"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s06-label-1",
        "v-model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-path",
      "text": {
        "en": "Training uses a straight path from noise to data; the denoiser learns the velocity, data minus noise.",
        "ru": "Обучение идет по прямому пути от шума к данным, и сеть предсказывает скорость как разность данных и шума."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#om-05-path"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s06-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-judge",
      "text": {
        "en": "A judge compares candidates with the target and an off-target panel; a solver picks exactly N designs.",
        "ru": "Оценщик сравнивает кандидатов с мишенью и панелью сторонних белков, а модуль отбора выбирает ровно N конструкций."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#om-07-judging"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s10-label-1",
        "v-tree"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-status",
      "text": {
        "en": "Arc Harness Phase 0 and Phase 1, Cammut, the Molecullage 231-source library, and the two base network modules exist in code; Phase 4 Research UI and Omniverso weights are designed and not yet trained.",
        "ru": "Фазы 0 и 1 среды Arc Harness, Cammut, библиотека Molecullage из 231 источника и два базовых сетевых модуля написаны в коде, а интерфейс фазы 4 и веса Omniverso спроектированы и еще не обучены."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-99-end"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s11-label-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-tree",
      "text": {
        "en": "Tree-HoH tests hypothesis branches by likelihood-ratio support score and value of information per cost, pruning weak branches via Sequential Halving into a claim graph.",
        "ru": "Дерево гипотез оценивает ветви по отношению правдоподобия и ценности информации на единицу затрат, отсекая слабые ветви методом последовательного деления в граф утверждений."
      },
      "level": "architecture",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-06-tree"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s10-title",
        "s10-label-1",
        "v-tree"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-gpu",
      "text": {
        "en": "Request: 8,320 GPU-hours on NVIDIA A100 80 GB in Yandex Cloud over 12 months, in two stages (A 2,080 h pilot, B 6,240 h).",
        "ru": "Запрос: 8,320 часов работы ускорителей NVIDIA A100 80 ГБ в Yandex Cloud на 12 месяцев в два этапа (этап A 2,080 часов, этап B 6,240 часов)."
      },
      "level": "target",
      "source": {
        "kind": "file",
        "ref": "motion/films/arc-science-pitch-2.film.json#as-99-end"
      },
      "usedBy": [
        "s11-title",
        "s11-label-1"
      ]
    }
  ],
