            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s00-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Arc Science is a scientific harness and computational platform for designing biomolecules.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 0,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s00-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Arc Science",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s00-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Arc Science — научная среда и вычислительная платформа для конструирования биомолекул.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 1,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s01-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Four projects on one shared base",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s01-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Four projects stand on one shared base: Omniverso, Snoggo, RNAv-G and Arc Chemistry.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 1,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s01-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Четыре проекта на одной общей основе",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s01-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Четыре проекта стоят на одной общей основе: Omniverso, Snoggo, RNAv-G и Arc Chemistry.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 2,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s02-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "The four workspaces",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "The console links four workspaces with Cammut, Arc Kit and the 231-source library.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 2,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s02-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Четыре рабочие области",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Консоль объединяет четыре рабочие области, память Cammut, пакет Arc Kit и полку из 231 источника.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 3,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s03-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "One result from source to sentence",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s03-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "PDB 1MEL shows camel VH with lysozyme at 2.5 A and 55 residue pairs.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 3,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s03-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Один результат от источника до фразы",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s03-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Структура PDB 1MEL показывает домен верблюда с лизоцимом при 2.5 А и 55 пар остатков.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 4,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s04-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Omniverso and its target",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s04-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "In PDB 1MEL, 24 lysozyme residues and 18 nanobody residues form 55 residue pairs within 4.5 A.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 4,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s04-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Omniverso и его мишень",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s04-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "В структуре PDB 1MEL 24 остатка лизоцима и 18 остатков нанотела образуют 55 пар остатков ближе 4.5 А.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 5,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s05-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "The loop that reaches into the target",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "One half of the loop contacts the domain while the other half enters the active site of lysozyme.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 5,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s05-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Петля в активном центре мишени",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Одна половина петли касается домена, а вторая половина глубоко входит в активный центр лизоцима.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 6,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s06-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Inside the model",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "The autoencoder has 255,873,676 parameters and the denoiser has 153,102,091 parameters along a straight path.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 6,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s06-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Устройство модели",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Автокодировщик содержит 255,873,676 параметров, а модуль снятия шума содержит 153,102,091 параметров на прямом пути.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 7,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s07-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Snoggo",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Snoggo estimates binding free energy changes for beta-tubulin mutations.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 7,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s07-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Snoggo",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Snoggo оценивает изменение свободной энергии связывания при мутациях бета-тубулина.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 8,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s08-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "RNAv-G",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s08-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "RNAv-G describes viral capsid assembly and genome placement.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 8,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s08-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "RNAv-G",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s08-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "RNAv-G описывает сборку вирусного капсида и укладку генома.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 9,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s09-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Arc Chemistry",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s09-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Arc Chemistry selects extractants to separate neodymium and praseodymium.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 9,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s09-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Arc Chemistry",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s09-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Arc Chemistry подбирает экстрагенты для разделения неодима и празеодима.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 10,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s10-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "How research is checked",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s10-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "The hypothesis tree prunes weak branches into a claim graph and the judge compares candidates.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 10,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s10-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Проверка гипотез и отбор",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s10-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Дерево гипотез отсекает слабые ветви в граф утверждений, а оценщик сравнивает кандидатов с мишенью.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 11,
      "lang": "en",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s11-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "What we ask of Yandex Cloud",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s11-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "We request 8,320 GPU-hours over 12 months in two stages: 2,080 h pilot and 6,240 h scale.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stop": 11,
      "lang": "ru",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s11-title",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Запрос к Yandex Cloud",
          "box": [
            96,
            770,
            1200,
            64
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s11-label-1",
          "role": "label",
          "text": "Мы запрашиваем 8,320 часов на 12 месяцев в два этапа: 2,080 часов и 6,240 часов.",
          "box": [
            96,
            842,
            1500,
            108
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
